{ZOAH%}:
WELCOME, GHOST-BOY!{wait(60)}
ARE YOU MAN ENOUGH
TO CHALLENGE ME?{wend(60)}

Dwarf Chieftain:
You befouler of
the forests!{wait(15)}
Human vermin!!!{bpage}
Prepare to receive
the anger of nature
that you so deserve!{wait(15)} Hi-ho!{bpage}
O great Hydra!{wait(15)}
Hear my voice!{wait(15)}
Turn on these
wretched humans{bpage}
Teach them how the
forest, no{wait(5)} -- our
planet --{wait(5)} is pained
by their existence!{bpage}
{speed(128)}Hi-ho, Hydra, away!{bwait}{fset(3)}{fwait(1)}{wend(1)}

Dwarf Chieftain:
What do you humans
intend to do with
our mother planet?{bpage}
Not thinking of the
future...{wait(5)}cutting
down trees like
there's no tomorrow!{bpage}
Burning the forests
to make your towns
even bigger!{wait(5)}
And all for what?{mend}

Dwarf Chieftain:
{speed(255)}Don't kid yourselves!{speed(128)}
You are just hairless
apes! Or worse, hi-ho!{bpage}
You are nothing more
than freaks of-{wait(15)}of-{wait(15)}of {wait(15)}
{speed(255)}evolution!!!!{wait(40)}{speed(128)}
Hiiii-hooooowwww-ugh!{mend}

