It's fairy sad,
but I can understand
what he says...{bpage}
Why, we fairies are
forest dwellers, too!{wait(20)}
But I don't think all
humans are bad!{bpage}
I'm sure that there are
many humanfolk who love
greenery and are kind to
the smallest of life-forms!{mend}

Now the final battle between
those sleeping dragons,
humans, and fate is about to
begin...{wait(90)}
When the time comes, {SERGE%},
on whose side will you stand?{wend(210)}

That's {KORCHA%}!
He's from Guldove.{bpage}
I wonder why he hangs
around here in Termina
all the time?{bpage}
You shouldn't mess
with the likes of him!
I tell you...he's
nothing but trouble!{mend}

