Only when you've defeated a
lion shark can you call yourself
a true man of the sea!{wait(20)}
Hehehe...!{mend}

Aghhh...!{wait(20)}
Please... Just don't
wreck our boats...!
Please, I beg of you!{bpage}
We live a quiet, humble life
in this here village.{wait(20)}
There is no way any of
us would oppose you!{mend}

The pier's up ahead.{wait(20)}
Listen, don't be messin'
with those boats.{bpage}
I'm sure you understand...
A boat is like a limb
to our fishermen.{bpage}
Pull any stunts like
last time, and I'll
whack you in the head!{mend}

I-I-I'm not
a-a-afraid of you!{wait(20)}
