Heckran bones!{bpage}
She'd do anything to
get her paws on one.
She'd obey your every
command if you gave her one.{mend}

CHEAPSKATE!
Fine, forget it then!{bpage}
Oh, my dear Kiki!{wait(20)}
My heart is full
of despair...!{mend}

Whatchoo got there...?
{itemwork(0)}...?{wait(20)}
That's not what I want!{bpage}
Don't get my hopes up
like that {-y}{SERGE%}.{wait(20)}
That {itemwork(0)} isn't
the key to her heart.{mend}

